# Screen objects

- Prefer the `screen-object-author` skill when adding or extending Appium screen objects.
- Files: `appium/screens/*.screen.ts`. Specs in `appium/specs/` call screens only—no raw selectors in specs.
- Selector priority (same as `ios-e2e-tests.mdc`):
  1. Accessibility id — `$("~<id>")`
  2. Predicate — only when needed; short comment why
  3. **Never XPath**
- Prefer ids that mirror web `data-testid`s when the screen exists on both platforms.
- Add missing SwiftUI `.accessibilityIdentifier`s in `ios/Marlow/Marlow/Features/` (and `App/`) as part of the same change.
- Keep one screen object per major screen (login, shop, cart, account, …).
